===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/θiˈɔɹ.boʊ/|a=GenAm}}
* {{IPA|en|/θiˈɔː.bəʊ/|a=RP}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|theorboes}}

# {{lb|en|musical instruments}} A [[baroque]], double-necked [[lute]] having an extra set of open [[bass]] [[string]]s.
#* {{RQ:Eddison Worm|31|So when they said yea to this, he called to him his player on the '''theorbo''' and his player on the hautboy, and commanded them saying, “Play me a solemn music.”}}

